2026-07-29T11:15:47.7573445Z > # CRAN guard
2026-07-29T11:15:47.7573609Z > #
2026-07-29T11:15:47.7573937Z > # The duckdb test suite exercises DuckDB's bundled C++ engine, which is too heavy
2026-07-29T11:15:47.7574407Z > # for CRAN's check farm, and checks were very fragile in the past. We therefore
2026-07-29T11:15:47.7574868Z > # keep it off on CRAN but run it automatically on GitHub Actions (GITHUB_ACTIONS)
2026-07-29T11:15:47.7575319Z > # and on r-universe (MY_UNIVERSE). An explicit DUCKDB_R_RUN_TESTS opts in
2026-07-29T11:15:47.7575770Z > # (true-ish) or out (false-ish) and always wins; otherwise we fall back to those.
2026-07-29T11:15:47.7576233Z > # This check is intentionally inlined here (rather than calling into the package)
2026-07-29T11:15:47.7576612Z > # so the guard is obvious and self-contained.
2026-07-29T11:15:47.7576972Z > run_tests <- tolower(trimws(Sys.getenv("DUCKDB_R_RUN_TESTS", "")))
